.TH SANCHALA-OVERVIEW 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-overview \- Desktop overview (Mission Control style)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-overview
[\fIcommand\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show all windows and workspaces in an overview, similar to macOS Mission Control.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B show
Activate overview mode
.TP
.B toggle
Toggle overview on/off
.TP
.B windows
Show window picker only
.TP
.B workspaces
Show workspace grid only
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUT
Default: Super key or configured hot corner
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-overview show
.TP
sanchala-overview toggle
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
